    <briefdescription>
<para>Safe wrapper for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_vector_index_manager" kindref="compound">VectorIndexManager</ref> with iterator safety. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Replace raw iterators with stable handles</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic invalidation detection on index removal</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fallback to stable ID-based lookup patterns</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Exception safety during iterator cleanup</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Gaps A-2-05 to A-2-08: Complete iterator safety for vector indices </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
